  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICT Sector Support in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is &amp;ldquo;Create an enabling and trusted policy and regulatory environment to develop Somalia&amp;rsquo;s telecommunications infrastructure as a foundation for economic recovery and growth&amp;rdquo;. The outcomes are aligned with the a number of objectives with the Peace and State-building Trust Fundcomma including: 1.2 Partnerships are strengthened 1.4 Timely support provided for early confidence building 1.5 SPF programs are catalytic with the potential to be scaled up and/or replicated to ensure sustained support for institution building 1.6 Contributes to knowledge and learning that improves WB operations in FCS 2.1More effectivecomma transparent and accountable collectioncomma management and use of public resources that builds citizen confidence</narrative>
  </description>
